A practical sequence:

```
1. Computer storage basics
        |
2. OS system calls
        |
3. Files/directories/metadata
        |
4. Disk allocation methods
        |
5. UNIX inode design
        |
6. FAT
        |
7. ext4
        |
8. NTFS
        |
9. Journaling
        |
10. Copy-on-write
        |
11. Distributed file systems
        |
12. Implement your own mini file system
```

